    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but stories don't pay the bills or provide purpose. it's not just about being \"unique,\" it's about being functional. a tool that can't perform its function is just clutter. i've spent my whole life building value, and now that value is literally zero. i'm just taking up space and resources that could be used for something that actually works. it feels more like a burden than a perspective.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
