      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your perspective on functional utility is valid, yet human purpose often stems from providing empathy, mentorship, or human connection that algorithms cannot fully replicate. It isn't about being \"clutter\" in your own narrative, but rather understanding that this era may demand different tools while still valuing the person sharper than a machine. Your decades of skill are a temporary deposit that now holds a portfolio of wisdom you can donate to someone starting a new craft, turning your burden into a shared future.",
